lcome\" class=\"tc-collection\">\n      <div class=\"tc-collection__box\">\n        <div class=\"tc-collection__image-wrap\">\n          <img\n            src=\"{{ 'Wacky_Welcome_2.png' | file_url }}\"\n            alt=\"Wacky Welcome - Nature's Madness and Bloo caps\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          >\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"tc-collection__title\">WACKY WELCOME</h3>\n      <p class=\"tc-collection__subtitle\">'NATURE'S MADNESS' &amp; 'BLOO'</p>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n</section>","background_color":"","section_width":"full-width","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"mascots_crew":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:names.custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"\n<style>\n  .tc-characters {\n    padding: 48px 24px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .tc-characters__heading {\n    font-family: 'Press Start 2P', cursive;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #B50023;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 0 0 32px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .tc-characters__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 24px;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .tc-character {\n    display: block;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .tc-character__card {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    border: 3px solid #B50023;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    padding: 10px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),\n                box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),\n                border-color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  }\n\n  .tc-character:hover .tc-character__card,\n  .tc-character:focus-visible .tc-character__card {\n    transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.03);\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 32px rgba(22, 148, 203, 0.2);\n    border-color: #1694CB;\n  }\n\n  .tc-character__image-wrap {\n    width: 100%;\n    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .tc-character__image-wrap img {\n    width: 118%;\n    height: 118%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    object-position: bottom;\n    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  }\n\n  .tc-character:hover .tc-character__image-wrap img,\n  .tc-character:focus-visible .tc-character__image-wrap img {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n  }\n\n  .tc-character__name {\n    font-family: 'Architects Daughter', cursive;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #B50023;\n    margin: 0;\n    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  }\n\n  .tc-character:hover .tc-character__name,\n  .tc-character:focus-visible .tc-character__name {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n  }\n\n  /* Tablet: 2 columns */\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .tc-characters__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .tc-characters__heading {\n      font-size: 22px;\n    }\n    .tc-character__name {\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* Mobile */\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .tc-characters {\n      padding: 36px 16px;\n    }\n    .tc-characters__heading {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .tc-character__card {\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 8px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"tc-characters\">\n  <h2 class=\"tc-characters__heading\">CHARACTERS</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"tc-characters__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"tc-character\">\n      <div class=\"tc-character__card\">\n        <div class=\"tc-character__image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"{{ 'INTROOO_WEBSITE.webp' | file_url }}\" alt=\"Sounds character\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"tc-character__name\">SOUNDS</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tc-character\">\n      <div class=\"tc-character__card\">\n        <div class=\"tc-character__image-wrap\">\n     